# User Stories & Feature Status

## User Story Implementation Status

### ✅ U1: Story Creation (Complete)
*As a creator, I open `localhost:3000`, click "New Story", enter a headline, 1–2 sentences, and source URLs.*

**Implementation:**
- Route: [src/app/stories/new/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/stories/new/page.tsx)
- Component: [src/components/story-creation-form.tsx](mdc:src/components/story-creation-form.tsx)
- Service: [src/services/story-service.ts](mdc:src/services/story-service.ts)
- Actions: [src/app/actions/story-actions.ts](mdc:src/app/actions/story-actions.ts)
- Validation: [src/lib/story-validation.ts](mdc:src/lib/story-validation.ts)

**Features:**
- Form validation with real-time error feedback
- Multi-source URL input support
- Server Actions integration
- Story dashboard at [/stories](mdc:src/app/stories/page.tsx)

### ✅ U2: Script Editing (Complete)
*As a creator, I can review/edit the AI-drafted ≤45-word script in the web UI before rendering.*

**Implementation:**
- Route: [src/app/stories/[id]/script/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/stories/[id]/script/page.tsx)
- Service: [src/services/script-service.ts](mdc:src/services/script-service.ts)
- Actions: [src/app/actions/script-actions.ts](mdc:src/app/actions/script-actions.ts)

**Features:**
- OpenAI integration with `gpt-4o-mini`
- RAG-based prompt engineering
- Real-time word count validation (≤45 words)
- Save/regenerate functionality

### 🚧 U3: Video Generation (Infrastructure Complete)
*As a creator, I hit "Generate Video" and, after processing, see the MP4 path plus a Download/Open link.*

**Implementation Status:**
- ✅ Route: [src/app/stories/[id]/generate/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/stories/[id]/generate/page.tsx)
- ✅ Services: All video generation services implemented
  - [src/services/tts-service.ts](mdc:src/services/tts-service.ts) - OpenAI TTS
  - [src/services/video-generation-service.ts](mdc:src/services/video-generation-service.ts) - Runway ML
  - [src/services/ffmpeg-service.ts](mdc:src/services/ffmpeg-service.ts) - Video assembly
  - [src/services/video-orchestration-service.ts](mdc:src/services/video-orchestration-service.ts) - Pipeline
- ✅ Actions: [src/app/actions/video-actions.ts](mdc:src/app/actions/video-actions.ts)
- ✅ Test Infrastructure: Comprehensive test coverage for all services
- 🚧 Final Integration: End-to-end pipeline and file output

## Database Schema
Core tables defined in [supabase/migrations/](mdc:supabase/migrations):
- `stories`: Story metadata and status
- `scripts`: AI-generated and edited scripts
- `assets`: Generated media files (audio, video, images)
- `videos`: Final output video files

## Status Flow
```
draft → editing → generating → done/failed
```

Stories progress through these statuses as they move through the pipeline.
